  "description": "Accessibility scanner for running Android and iOS apps, with first-class .NET MAUI support. Wraps Apple's accessibility audit and Google's Accessibility Test Framework, can drive real TalkBack capture on Android, maps findings to WCAG 2.2 and labels the standards they are relevant to (Section 508, EN 301 549 and others), and writes JSON, HTML, Markdown ticket, CSV and PDF reports. Automated checks find only some issues; manual testing is still required.",
